== summaries
  hash: Non-cryptographic hashes.
  csv: Comma separated values with quoting ("" inside quoted fields).
  bits: Bit operations that have no operator.
  config: Configuration files by their extension: .json, .toml, .yaml/.yml, .properties/.cfg/.ini (see the modules of those names).
== docs
  fnv1a native nv_hash_fnv1a doc [64-bit FNV-1a, always >= 0]
  signature method fnv1a(string text): integer
